{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ZEC","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"撒迦利亞書","commonName":"撒迦利亞書","title":"撒迦利亞書","order":38,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"43ae9327f3a9401b8ec950d5d27f64f048bbd7ac8d6d42e14967d229e27fd011","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEC/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":211},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["金燈臺和橄欖樹"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["那位與我說話的天使又來喚醒我，像喚醒睡覺的人一樣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["他問我：「你看見了什麼？」 我說：「我看見一個純金的燈臺，燈台頂端有一個油碗，燈臺上有七盞燈，每盞燈有七個燈芯。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["燈臺旁邊有兩棵橄欖樹，左右各一棵。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我問與我說話的天使：「主啊，這是什麼意思？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["他說：「你不知道嗎？」我說：「主啊，我不知道。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["他對我說：「這是耶和華對所羅巴伯講的話。萬軍之耶和華說，『不靠權勢，不靠才能，乃靠我的靈。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["大山啊，你算什麼？你必在所羅巴伯面前化為平地。他必搬出那塊封殿頂的石頭，伴隨著歡呼聲：願恩典、恩典歸於這殿！』」"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["耶和華對我說："]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["「所羅巴伯的手已經奠立這殿的根基，他的手也必完成這項工程。那時你便知道，是萬軍之耶和華差遣我到你們這裡來的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["誰敢藐視這微不足道的日子？他們看見所羅巴伯手中拿著線錘時，就必歡喜。這七盞燈是耶和華遍察天下的眼睛。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["我又問天使：「燈臺左右的兩棵橄欖樹是什麼意思？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["然後我又問道：「流出金色橄欖油的兩個金管旁邊的兩根橄欖枝是什麼意思？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["他說：「你不知道嗎？」我說：「主啊，我不知道。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["他說：「這是侍立在天下之主旁邊的兩位受膏者。」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEC/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEC/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEC/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}